# db/**/*.sql

- Numbered migrations/views by dependency; do not break extract refresh.
- Tunables in `control_panel` only. Never wipe campaign-entered columns on promote.
- Before view math changes: `db/AUDIT.md`, `db/test/`. Prefer Auto Intelligence / strong model for view arithmetic.
